<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia July palm oil exports 710,836 -SGS.</title>
<headline>Malaysia July palm oil exports 710,836 -SGS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor Societe Generale de Surveillance (SGS) Malaysia Sdn Bhd on Thursday it said it estimated Malaysia's palm oil exports for July at 710,836 tonnes against 611,368 tonnes for June.</p>
<p>It said the exports comprised 209,456 tonnes of RBD palm oil, 288,313 tonnes of RBD palm olein and 88,245 tonnes of RBD palm stearin. The other products totalled 124,822 tonnes.</p>
